            "text": "No. Water still passes through cured polymeric joints into the bedding layer, just more slowly than through loose sand. Most patios shed rain across the surface anyway. The exception is permeable paver systems, which rely on open joints filled with chip stone; neither polymeric nor regular sand should be used in those."
