            "text": "Yes, if you choose a product designed for wide joints. Fine paver polymeric sand cracks in gaps wider than its rating, typically around half an inch to an inch. Wide-joint binders use a coarser grain made for flagstone. Regular sand or stone dust remains an option for informal flagstone paths where some weeding is acceptable."
